## VERDICT

**NEEDS_FIXES**

Low-rung items (migration I/A/V mapping, revalidation A-before-V, baseline A-before-V, V-order + K/L post-verify, ALP-01/KLW-01, `authorizer_contiguous_watermark`, OpenCode deferred, ordinary-delivery wording, clarify authority path, APO pin language) look incorporated in readable text. Medium-rung still finds material contradictions and SM/catalog holes that block CLEAN.

