## SUMMARY

Locked clarify Q1–Q11 are largely reflected (full AF+Workflow routes, Authorizer + runtime-home keys, GLM 5.2, unlimited Process nesting, RFL hard cut, I→A→V + K/L, OpenCode deferred, `critical_policy` in-repo, ALP-01/KLW-01). Medium-rung still **NEEDS_FIXES** mainly for: live `a_loop_not_applicable` vs universal A-loop; missing ordinary-delivery SM; unlocked A-loop scope; unnamed six migration states; blocker/receipt catalog orphans (`blocked_depth_unsupported`, `migration_not_activated`); K/L fail-closed holes; toolstack five-tool table parity. Prefer fixing F-1–F-7 before High rung; verify Broker absence and mirror `cmp` on raw bytes.
